sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Editor
    participant W as MainWindow (GUI thread)
    participant M as JobManager
    participant J as TranscriptionJob (worker thread)
    participant F as ffmpeg
    participant A as Whisper backend
    participant S as Segmenter and rules

    U->>W: Transcribe
    W->>M: start(job)
    M-->>W: busy_changed(true)
    M->>J: run on thread pool
    J->>F: extract 16 kHz mono WAV
    F-->>J: audio file
    J-->>W: progress(15) signal
    J->>A: transcribe(audio, progress, cancel event)
    loop each recognised segment
        A-->>J: timed words
        J-->>W: progress(15..85) signal
        J->>J: stop early if cancel event is set
    end
    J->>S: segment(words, shot cuts, profile)
    S-->>J: cues
    J->>S: validate(cues)
    S-->>J: violations
    J-->>W: finished(result) signal
    W->>W: update table, waveform, problem list
    M-->>W: busy_changed(false)
